#: includes/classes/class-overview-settings.php:151
msgid "This plugin is a great starting point for analyzing the compatibility of a standard WordPress site with the WordPress VIP platform. It scans your site for potential issues by identifying unsupported plugins, directories, database configurations, and other incompatibilities with VIP requirements."
msgstr ""

#: includes/classes/class-overview-settings.php:155
msgid "In addition to highlighting compatibility issues, the plugin also provides several options to address and fix known problems. However, it's important to note that this plugin is not a complete solution for making a WordPress site fully VIP-compatible. It serves as a tool for identifying and resolving common issues, but further manual adjustments and optimizations may be required to meet the platform's strict standards."
msgstr ""

#: includes/classes/class-overview-settings.php:159
msgid "While this plugin can fix certain issues, it should be seen as an initial tool to help assess and prepare your site for VIP migration. For more advanced optimizations and compliance, a thorough manual review may still be required."
msgstr ""

